<speak>I will, Rachel. Everything goes back into the study folder, and the keepsakes can wait for another day. Thanks again for the measured pace and for talking through the practical organisation with me. It has been a proper conversation rather than another thing squeezed between meetings. I'll go and join the family now before they decide I've disappeared into paperwork again. Enjoy the rest of your afternoon, and we'll arrange the next telephone slot when there's something administrative to discuss. Goodbye.</speak>